<span id="S3.T7.4.1.1.1.1.1.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_center">Construction</span></span>
</span></span></td>
<td id="S3.T7.4.1.1.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_tt" colspan="3">Multi-path Retrieval</td>
<td id="S3.T7.4.1.1.3" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_center ltx_border_tt" rowspan="2"><span id="S3.T7.4.1.1.3.1" class="ltx_text">
<span id="S3.T7.4.1.1.3.1.1" class="ltx_tabular ltx_align_middle">
